{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52578","headline":"题会福塔院诗 · 宋之问","name":"题会福塔院诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"如涌浮图近紫霄，芙蓉仙苑礼羣僚。\n海天遥奉金轮日，尽遣祯祥归圣朝。\n（见清修《日下旧闻考》卷一二五引《宋延清集》）（按：此塔院清时称三塔寺，在永清县，其上有唐圣历元年石刻。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52578.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52578","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}